flowchart TB
  accTitle: Evidence-to-dossier flow
  accDescr: A caller-owned source adapter normalizes public or entitled evidence through a provider-neutral SourcePort boundary. The caller derives typed terminal lineage fields from retained batches, while sanitized failed attempts and coverage gaps remain caller receipts that must be declared as limitations when decision-relevant. StockResearchAgents validates provenance, time, licensing, claims, and calculations in the complete CompanyAnalyticsSubmissionV1 before publishing CompanyAnalyticsResultV1; a rejected terminal submission is not published.

  subgraph H["Caller-owned retrieval"]
    direction LR
    SRC["Public or entitled source<br/><small>filing · market · publisher · macro</small>"]
    ADAPTER["Caller source adapter<br/><small>credentials · terms · pagination · retries</small>"]
    PORT["SourcePort.fetch<br/><small>capability + typed query</small>"]
    COLLECT["SourcePortfolioCollector<br/><small>validate routes · isolate failures</small>"]
    BATCH["Retained SourceBatch<br/><small>bounded facts · provenance · entitlement</small>"]
    ATTEMPT["Portfolio attempt receipt<br/><small>sanitized failures · coverage gaps</small>"]
    SRC --> ADAPTER --> PORT --> COLLECT
    COLLECT --> BATCH
    COLLECT --> ATTEMPT
  end

  subgraph P["StockResearchAgents evidence and research contracts"]
    direction LR
    LINEAGE["Source lineage crosswalk<br/><small>identity · digest scope · entitlement</small>"]
    DOSSIER["Caller analytics submission<br/><small>documents · claims · calculations</small>"]
    LIMIT["Declared coverage limitation<br/><small>partial · stale · blocked · missing</small>"]
    GATE{"Validation gate<br/><small>time · references · licensing · safety</small>"}
    DONE[["Completed Research Dossier<br/><small>immutable published artifact</small>"]]
    LINEAGE --> DOSSIER --> GATE
    LIMIT --> DOSSIER
    GATE -->|accepted| DONE
  end

  subgraph R["Completed-only readers"]
    direction LR
    VIEW["RunView / Dossier Viewer"]
    EXPORT["JSON / Markdown / MCP"]
  end

  REJECT["Typed terminal rejection<br/><small>no completed publication</small>"]

  BATCH -->|caller derives terminal lineage fields| LINEAGE
  ATTEMPT -. caller declares decision-relevant gap .-> LIMIT
  GATE -->|rejected| REJECT
  DONE --> VIEW
  DONE --> EXPORT

  classDef host fill:#fff4df,stroke:#ad6500,color:#071c26,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef port fill:#eef3ff,stroke:#2257ff,color:#071c26,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef validated fill:#e5f7f5,stroke:#00746e,color:#071c26,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef artifact fill:#ffffff,stroke:#1231a6,color:#071c26,stroke-width:3px;
  classDef rejected fill:#fff0ef,stroke:#b42318,color:#071c26,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef read fill:#ffffff,stroke:#516a75,color:#071c26,stroke-width:2px;
  class SRC,ADAPTER,BATCH host;
  class PORT,DOSSIER,GATE port;
  class LINEAGE validated;
  class DONE artifact;
  class LIMIT validated;
  class REJECT rejected;
  class VIEW,EXPORT read;
